---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../components/Container.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---
<Layout>
    <Nav/>
    <Container>
        <div class="flex">
            <div>
                <h2>Featured Work</h2
                    <p>
                        In today's world, stories are currency. From the first words though to the finished product, we can help you make an impact.
                    </p>
                </div>
        <div>
            <h2>Capabilities</h2>
            <p>Some may say art and science don't mix, but we can't see it any other way. Your project needs both, so why change now?</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h2>Get In Touch</h2>
            <p>
                If you have an idea that's out of the ordinary, we want to hear it. Pitch your idea to a team who can see the future of storytelling.
            </p>
        </div>
        </div>
    </Container>
    <Footer/>
</Layout>
